AltoChainlinkERC4626RatioMultiplierOracle::getPrice()
├── when chainlink feed is stale
│   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidRate
├── when chainlink price is zero
│   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidRate
├── when chainlink price is within ERC4626 max allowed growth
│   ├── it should return the unchained price scaled by the multiplier
│   ├── it should not cap the intermediate price
│   └── it should apply chainlink conversion with correct in and out decimals
└── when chainlink price exceeds ERC4626 max allowed growth
    ├── it should cap the intermediate price to the max allowed growth ratio
    └── it should return the capped price scaled by the multiplier
